Z||000000||Pattyb||07-13-2000||02:44 AM||||I was just curious about how many people would be interested if I were to offer dash kits for the fiero.  These kits come from Florida Auto Trim and are available in natural and synthetic.  The price on the synthetic would be about $130.00 and the naturals would be about $170.00. Group discount available.  This price includes an 8 piece kit for Auto or man.  <P>Other pieces would be available including a 2 piece glovebox, 2 piece power door trim, 1 piece auto shifter indicator, and a 2 piece power switch with the mirror plug.<P>In synthetics they have carbon fiber and about 7 different woods.  On authentic carbon fiber there are 9 different variety and colors and 12 different woods.<P>Post if anyone is interested.  I am trying to put up a better website.<P>Pat<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||07-13-2000||07:10 AM||||Is this a dash kit or a center console kit?$130-$170 sounds too low (too good to be true) for a dash assembly.<P>If you could post some photos of the product that would be helpful.<P>The center consoles, glove box , console shift assembly all seem to pull apart and curl with age and replacements are limited and I've never been sucessful at gluing them back down.||||reg||10
